---
layout: layouts/page.njk
permalink: /thank-you/
title: Thank you
metaTitle: "Thank you – City College of Management"
metaDescription: "Your enquiry has reached the admission team at City College of Management, Lucknow."
h1: Thank you — we have your enquiry
noindex: true
hideCta: true
---
<section class="section" aria-labelledby="ty-head">
  <div class="wrap wrap--prose reveal">
    <h2 id="ty-head">What happens next</h2>
    <ol class="steps">
      <li>An admission counsellor calls or messages you, usually within one working day.</li>
      <li>We confirm your eligibility and answer your questions about fees and dates.</li>
      <li>We arrange a campus visit for counselling and document verification.</li>
    </ol>
    <p>In a hurry? Call the admission helpline on <a href="{{ site.phoneHref }}" data-track="call">{{ site.phone | ph | safe }}</a>
      or message us on <a href="{{ site.whatsappHref }}" data-track="whatsapp">WhatsApp</a>.
      Office hours: {{ site.officeHours | ph | safe }}.</p>

    <h2>While you wait, read about the programmes</h2>
    <ul class="chips">
      {%- for p in programmes %}
      <li><a class="chip" href="/courses/{{ p.slug }}/">{{ p.name }} &mdash; {{ p.duration }}</a></li>
      {%- endfor %}
    </ul>

    <p style="margin-top:var(--sp-5)">
      <a class="btn btn--primary" href="/admissions/">Admissions {{ site.admissionSession }}</a>
      <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="/campus-life/">Campus life</a>
      <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="/">Back to home</a>
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
